l consisting of at least 3 members and chaired by a former judge; and* >>>> >>>> *(iii) shortlisting of at least 3 persons for the appointment that are certified, in writing, by the panel to meet all of the selection criteria; and* >>> >>> *(b) the person is one of the shortlisted candidates.* >> >> *(5) Within 7 days after a person is appointed as a Board member, the Minister must cause a copy of the written certification for the person (referred to in subparagraph (4)(a)(iii)) to be:* >> >>> *(a) tabled in each House of the Parliament; or* >>> >>> *(b) if a House is not sitting—presented to the Presiding Officer of that House for circulation to the members of that House.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-representatives-8945","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/representatives/2024-06-04/2"}
